
The Lord of the Rings game engine
=================================

All documetation is in the doc/ directory

Project homepage:
http://www.wonderland.cz/lotr/

This game is Free/Libre/OpenSource Software released under LPGL 2.1 or higher

Saved games
===========

Each full game edition has its own slots 0 through 9. Saves are stored in ~/.lotr
on Linux or in the saves directory on Windows.

To import an older Wonderland save, keep the original filename
(savegame.N for Volume I, savegame2.N for Volume II) in that directory.
Launch the edition that created it, choose Options > Import Legacy, and
enter N. This copies the save into the same slot if it is empty. Then
choose Load Game. Older Volume I saves share a filename, so select the
edition that created the save before importing it.

To carry characters from Volume I into The Two Towers, choose New Game
and select Standard DOS, Enhanced CD, or Legacy Save, then the slot.
Legacy Save reads a Volume I save directly. Choose X to start fresh.
